TI  - ‘Let's Talk about Emotions!’. The Effect of Conversational Training on Preschoolers' Emotion Comprehension and Prosocial Orientation
AU  - Veronica Ornaghi
AU  - I Grazzani
AU  - E Cherubin
AU  - Elisabetta Conte
AU  - F Piralli
JO  - Social Development
PY  - 2014
VL  - 24
