TI  - An In Situ, Child-Led Intervention to Promote Emotion Regulation Competence in Middle Childhood: Protocol for an Exploratory Randomized Controlled Trial
AU  - Petr Slovák
AU  - Brett Q. Ford
AU  - Sherri C. Widen
AU  - Claudia Daudén Roquet
AU  - Nikki Theofanopoulou
AU  - James J. Gross
AU  - Benjamin L. Hankin
AU  - Predrag Klasnja
JO  - JMIR Research Protocols
PY  - 2021
